{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.poster.avif?t=1773929673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.webm?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.mp4?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcadia Cafe</strong> is a domestic horror game about a college student working late shifts in the nameless city in Ukraine. During night shifts, you will meet strange, bizarre characters with their own needs. Serve well, or consequences may affect your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/588ae643ecdb43f051d8fa67aba1bbb2.poster.avif?t=1773929673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/588ae643ecdb43f051d8fa67aba1bbb2.webm?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/588ae643ecdb43f051d8fa67aba1bbb2.mp4?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Domestic Horror: </strong>Simple, mundane, routine work becomes a nightmare when you don't expect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night shift worker gameplay:</strong> take the role of a night shift worker in a roadside cafe and meet strange, bizarre guests with their own needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ukrainian Theme:</strong> Environmental art inspired by the unique culture of Ukraine in the early 2000s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0The VHS aesthetic makes one feel like they're in the early 2000s. Interlacing and jitter in the analog video signal add extra immersion to the horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/636270?t=1773929673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/636270?t=1773929673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/e9613d4ad51cf399f6451846be1bcd0ef8d04366/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773929673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/e9613d4ad51cf399f6451846be1bcd0ef8d04366/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773929673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"SteamVR Collectibles","id":40},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.poster.avif?t=1773929673\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.webm?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636270/extras/e31fbd053c2c92d697d5820ddedbcca5.mp4?t=1773929673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video><